/*
  UpdateAvailableCallout.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0259 · UpdateAvailableCallout (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface (table "UpdateAvailableCallout").
  These entries fold into the app Localizable.xcstrings master catalog at integration time;
  they are kept in a per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings
  without editing the shared catalog.

  PARITY NOTE: the web source
  (web/src/features/system/components/status/UpdateAvailableCallout.tsx) hardcodes its copy
  as English literals and makes NO t() calls. The first group below PROMOTES those literals
  verbatim into localizable keys (so the native surface holds no hardcoded English). The
  `{{version}}` / `{{timestamp}}` tokens mirror the web template expressions (`v${latest}`,
  `v${current}`, formatDateTime(checkedAt)). The final group backs the native chrome the
  Apple HIG states contract requires — the external-link VoiceOver hint (the web gets it
  implicitly from <a target="_blank">) and the P4 stale/offline freshness chips (the web
  shows none).
*/

/* --- Heading (web `Update available{latest ? ` — v${latest}` : ''}`) --- */
